            <p><span class="font-medium text-[#1A1A1A]">Douyin videos:</span> up to 60 seconds. Client-provided footage edited and subtitled by us. AI-generated videos capped at 15 seconds, brief approved before production.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </Container>
