          </p>

          <div class="grid grid-cols-2 max-[640px]:grid-cols-1 gap-[16px]">
            <div class="bg-[rgba(255,255,255,0.06)] border-[0.5px] border-[rgba(255,255,255,0.1)] rounded-[10px] p-[24px]">
              <p class="text-[14px] text-[rgba(255,255,255,0.5)] font-normal mb-[8px]">Under $15K/mo ad spend</p>
              <p class="text-[28px] text-[#FFFFFF] font-medium leading-[1.2] mb-[16px]">$1,500<span class="text-[14px] text-[rgba(255,255,255,0.5)] font-normal">/mo</span></p>
              <div class="text-[13px] text-[rgba(255,255,255,0.6)] font-normal leading-[2]">
                <p>Full-funnel ads strategy</p>
                <p>Unlimited campaigns & ads</p>
                <p>Unlimited expert support</p>
                <p>Customized reporting</p>
                <p>Ad content guidance</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-[#CC3333] rounded-[12px] p-[24px]">
              <p class="text-[14px] text-[rgba(255,255,255,0.7)] font-normal mb-[8px]">Over $15K/mo ad spend</p>
              <p class="text-[28px] text-[#FFFFFF] font-medium leading-[1.2] mb-[16px]">6-10%<span class="text-[14px] text-[rgba(255,255,255,0.7)] font-normal"> of spend</span></p>
              <div class="text-[13px] text-[rgba(255,255,255,0.8)] font-normal leading-[2]">
