        <div class="max-w-[680px]">
          <h3 class="text-[18px] text-[#1A1A1A] font-medium leading-[1.3] mb-[16px]">Notes</h3>
          <div class="text-[14px] text-[#5C5C5C] font-normal leading-[1.8]">
            <p>All prices are tax excluded. Local taxes apply based on billing entity (Shanghai or Hong Kong).</p>
            <p>Payment terms: monthly in advance.</p>
            <p>Onboarding: account setup and first content within 2 weeks of contract signing.</p>
            <p>Add-on platforms can be added to any package at per-post rates.</p>
            <p>Custom packages available for non-standard scope. <a href="/contact" class="text-[#CC3333] font-medium transition-colors duration-150 hover:text-[#B02D2D]">Book a call</a>.</p>
